 237:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c **** /**
 238:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   * @brief This function configures the source of the time base.
 239:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   *        The time source is configured  to have 1ms time base with a dedicated 
 240:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   *        Tick interrupt priority.
 241:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   * @note This function is called  automatically at the beginning of program after
 242:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   *       reset by HAL_Init() or at any time when clock is reconfigured  by HAL_RCC_ClockConfig().
 243:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   * @note In the default implementation, SysTick timer is the source of time base. 
